Satanaðû, kaiú metaú</FOREIGN>  [ <HI REND="ITALIC">F. leg.</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>kataú] twðn 1Ekklhsiwðn touð Qeouð
maivnetai, kaiú ojrqopodouðntaû ejn pivstei touúû aJpantacovse
laouúû peiraðtai diastrevfein. Ouj gaúr hjremeið toú pampovnhron
ejkeiðno qhrivon kaiú</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0448" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0448D"></COL> Forte,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajfovrhton.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>eujfovrhton eijû ajsevbeian. 1Esivgwn
