 <COL N="0454B"></COL> kaiú miaðé gnwvmhé sthðnai, kaiú ejpagwnivsasqai thðé ojrqhðé pivstei
polemoumevnhé.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0454"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>4Oson gaúr toú kat1 aujtoún, kaiú oiJ patevreû hJmwðn oiJ megavloi
kaiú qaumastoiú kaiú eujdovkimoi Qeotovkon eiønai thún aJgivan
eijpovnteû parqevnon ajneqemativsqhsan, kaiú hJmeiðû deú suún
