uiJoún touð Qeouð, kaiú ajnasthðnai, oJ aænqrwpoû ajpevqane, kaiú
oJ aænqrwpoû ajnevsth× kaiú oujdeún</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0456" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0456C"></COL> Forte,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>toiouðto.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touðto proúû toún touð
Qeouð lovgon.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0456"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Kaiú hJmeiðû meún gaúr oJmologouðmen oåti kaiú ajqavnatovû ejstin
 <COL N="0456B"></COL> oJ touð Qeouð lovgoû kaiú zwhv ejstin× ajllaú pisteuvomen oåti
gevgone saúrx, toutevstin eJnwvsaû eJautwðé thún savrka metaú
