qrovnou thðé hJmetevraé</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="h" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0464" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0464D"></COL> In mss.,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>dochðé.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>diadochðé crhsavmenoû, tauvthn
ejkbibavseiû ajkribeið sterjrJovthti thún ajpovfasin, iåna hÞ ejntoúû
