Metaú tosauvthû provteron uJpolhvyewû eæzhsaû, wåste kaiú
 <COL N="0472B"></COL> ejfqovnhse toiðû soiðû ajllotriva povliû× metaú tosauvthû deú nuðn
ajtopivaû feuktevon seautoún paraskeuvasas, wJû touúû souúû
ejn ajllotrivoiû oJraðén, oåpwû ajphllavghsan.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0472"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Prwvhn ejdexavmeqa taúû saúû ejpistolaúû, aißû ejn stenwðé oujk
hjdunhvqhmen ajpokrivnasqai× eædei gaúr toún lovgon eijû 2Rwmaiçkoún
