kaqolikhú 1Ekklhsiva noeið, kaqwðû kaiú hJ eujagestavth twðn
 <COL N="0500A"></COL> Kwnstantinoupolitwðn ejkklhsiva mevcri souð, wø Bevltiste,
ejnovhse, kataú thún ejkteqeiðsan pivstin ejn thðé Nikaivwn sunovdwé,
kaiú eij mhú tauvthn thún duvspiston kainovthta sebasthðé
