aujthú uJpovqesiû eJauthún ejkdikeið.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0508"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Anapolhvswmen pavlin kajékeiðna taú rJhvmata touð hJmetevrou</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="m" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0508" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0508D"></COL> Leg.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>didaskavlou.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>despovtou, oißû ijdikwðû ejcrhvsato</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="n" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0508" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0508D"></COL> Leg.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>proúû touúû ejpiskovpouû.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>diaú twðn oijkeivwn
ejpiskovpwn, touðta paraggevllwn. Prosevcete, fhsiún,
