 <NOTE N="e" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509D"></COL> Leg.  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>protrevpw.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>propempevtw, ajdelfoiú timiwvtatoi, ejkeivnh movnh periskopeivsqw
hJ</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0509" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0509D"></COL> Leg.:  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Agavph, ejn hßé mevnein ojfeivlomen katav.</FOREIGN></NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>gnwvmh kataú thún fwnhún 1Iwavnnou touð
eujaggelistouð, ouß taú leivyana parovnteû tetimhvkate× eæstw
koinhú eujchú proúû toún kuvrion. Oiædamen poiva duvnamiû thðû
 <COL N="0510B"></COL> qeivaû aujtouð kaiú ejsomevnhû parousivaû eæstai, parakalouvshû
oJmoyuvcwû thðû tosauvthû twðn iJerevwn plhquvoû×
